   "stem": {
      "text": "Let \\( f \\) be the function that satisfies \\( f''(x) = \\left(f'(x)\\right)^{2} + x f(x) \\), with \\( f(0) = 2 \\) and \\( f'(0) = -1 \\). Find the third-degree Taylor polynomial for \\( f \\) about \\( x = 0 \\)."
